{"cv":[{"lang":"협업","names":["Patricia Summersett"]}],"lines":[{"t":"Appointed as Assistant","x":"Brace yourselves.","u":null,"p":"HOME_PLACE"},{"t":"Talk 1","x":"The most important thing my safta taught me was that life shouldn't have too many taboos.","u":null,"p":"HOME_SHOW"},{"t":"Talk 2","x":"Focus on the work at hand and don't jump to any conclusions.","u":null,"p":"HOME_SHOW"},{"t":"Talk 3","x":"Tachanka's taught me a thing or two about how to build defenses.","u":null,"p":"HOME_SHOW"},{"t":"Talk after Promotion 1","x":"I have some questions, Doctor. I hope you can answer them for me.","u":{"type":"AWAKE","param":"1"},"p":"HOME_SHOW"},{"t":"Talk after Promotion 2","x":"Overcoming obstacles and breaking down barriers makes a lot of things easier.","u":{"type":"AWAKE","param":"2"},"p":"HOME_SHOW"},{"t":"Talk after Trust Increase 1","x":"I'm willing to try, as long as the reward is commensurate to the risk.","u":{"type":"FAVOR","param":"40"},"p":"HOME_SHOW"},{"t":"Talk after Trust Increase 2","x":"You think I'm strict, huh? I'll take that as a compliment.","u":{"type":"FAVOR","param":"100"},"p":"HOME_SHOW"},{"t":"Talk after Trust Increase 3","x":"Do me a favor. You worry about the strategy and let me worry about the tactics.","u":{"type":"FAVOR","param":"200"},"p":"HOME_SHOW"},{"t":"Idle","x":"Time's up, Doc.","u":null,"p":"HOME_WAIT"},{"t":"Onboard","x":"Rainbow Operator, codename Ash. I have my authorization and I'm ready for assignment.","u":null,"p":"GACHA"},{"t":"Watching Battle Record","x":"The more we can learn about their attack patterns, the better off we'll be.","u":null,"p":"LEVEL_UP"},{"t":"Promotion 1","x":"You have my respect, Doc.","u":{"type":"AWAKE","param":"1"},"p":"EVOLVE_ONE"},{"t":"Promotion 2","x":"You can't really understand a conflict until you've been on both sides.","u":{"type":"AWAKE","param":"2"},"p":"EVOLVE_TWO"},{"t":"Added to Squad","x":"It's ready.","u":null,"p":"SQUAD"},{"t":"Appointed as Squad Leader","x":"Let's get our heads in the game.","u":null,"p":"SQUAD_FIRST"},{"t":"Depart","x":"Let's show them what we can do.","u":null,"p":"BATTLE_START"},{"t":"Begin Operation","x":"Targets detected.","u":null,"p":"BATTLE_FACE_ENEMY"},{"t":"Selecting Operator 1","x":"I'm all stocked up.","u":null,"p":"BATTLE_SELECT"},{"t":"Selecting Operator 2","x":"Ready to go!","u":null,"p":"BATTLE_SELECT"},{"t":"Deployment 1","x":"Move!","u":null,"p":"BATTLE_PLACE"},{"t":"Deployment 2","x":"Let's go!","u":null,"p":"BATTLE_PLACE"},{"t":"In Battle 1","x":"Watch for the blast.","u":null,"p":"BATTLE_SKILL_1"},{"t":"In Battle 2","x":"Stay clear of the blast.","u":null,"p":"BATTLE_SKILL_2"},{"t":"In Battle 3","x":"Get clear!","u":null,"p":"BATTLE_SKILL_3"},{"t":"In Battle 4","x":"Target spotted!","u":null,"p":"BATTLE_SKILL_4"},{"t":"4-star Result","x":"That worked out better than I expected.","u":null,"p":"FOUR_STAR"},{"t":"3-star Result","x":"No more than usual.","u":null,"p":"THREE_STAR"},{"t":"Sub 3-star Result","x":"We knew the risks. We still have to see this through.","u":null,"p":"TWO_STAR"},{"t":"Operation Failure","x":"We have to go.","u":null,"p":"LOSE"},{"t":"Assigned to Facility","x":"This is the place.","u":null,"p":"BUILDING_PLACE"},{"t":"Tap","x":"Well?","u":null,"p":"BUILDING_TOUCHING"},{"t":"Trust Tap","x":"We need to talk.","u":null,"p":"BUILDING_FAVOR_BUBBLE"},{"t":"Title","x":"Arknights.","u":null,"p":"LOADING_PANEL"},{"t":"Greeting","x":"I'm with you.","u":null,"p":"GREETING"}]}